    {
      "label": "Body Copy",
      "required": true,
      "section": "top",
      "unit": null,
      "value": "Strip dirt, grime and green build-up from driveways, patios, fencing and vehicles with the Spectrum LPW2200 \u2014 a 2200W mains-electric pressure washer that delivers up to 170 bar of working pressure and a 450 L/hr flow rate, putting it firmly in semi-professional territory while still plugging into a standard 13A socket.\nBuilt to last, not to disposable\nWhere most pressure washers in this price band rely on plastic pump components that fail under sustained use, the LPW2200 is built around a brass pump head and ceramic-coated pistons. That's the same construction philosophy you'll find in machines costing twice as much, and it's the single biggest reason this unit is backed by Spectrum's 5-year warranty (T&C's apply).\nQuick to deploy, tidy to store\nIntegrated wheels and a transport handle let you move the machine around without lifting. A rotating cord holder means no more wrestling with tangled cable, and on-board storage keeps the lance, hose and accessories tidy between jobs. The 5m mains cable and 5m steel-braided high-pressure hose give you a useful working radius without needing extension leads.\nCleaning kit included as standard\nMost washers ship with a single lance and leave you to buy the rest. The LPW2200 comes complete with a flat brush, fixed brush and rotary brush, plus a built-in detergent tank so you can add the right cleaning solution for the surface you're working on \u2014 ideal for car bodywork, decking restoration or stubborn patio stains.\nVariable pressure for every task\nA pressure and flow-rate control lets you dial the machine down for paintwork or up for sealed concrete, so a single tool covers everything from a careful car wash to blasting moss out of block paving. Maximum water inlet temperature is 50\u00b0C.\nWhy buy from MowDirect\n5-year Spectrum warranty (T&C's apply) \u2014 supported directly by us, not by a generic distributor\nUK stock, UK dispatch, UK after-sales\nSpare parts and service support available throughout the warranty period\nMain Image 1 *\n['UNSAFE_STRING_PREFIX_image_main_1']\nSecondary Image 1\nSecondary Image 2\nSecondary Image 3\nSecondary Image 4\nSecondary Image 5\nSecondary Image 6\nSecondary Image 7\nSecondary Image 8\nSafety Information Asset 1 - Digital Assets 01W\nSafety Information Asset 2 - Digital Assets 02W\nSafety Information Asset 3 - Digital Assets 03W\nSafety Information Asset 4 - Digital Assets 04W\nSafety Information Asset 5 - Digital Assets 05W\nProduct Identification 1\nProduct Identification 2\nProduct Identification 3\nVideo\nProduct Guide\nProduct Instruction Manual\nSafety Manual\nEU Warning_Safety Information\nDeclaration of Conformity\nSafety Test Report 1\nDeclaration of Identity\nSafety Test Report 2\nSafety Test Report 3",
      "api_name": "Body Copy"
    },
